g", "id": "1400400355321588", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/604282317_1400400358654921_4757121650969395822_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=UtShZYAwriwQ7kNvwFz-lyZ&_nc_oc=Adpr5bvXdr3guA2kpBXQEdOSrBi_Rg_oow4DdudhWhPoBoQz-HGYTd59Eq8G-ekaomE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQTE5A7Dhh3aMZWOTF6t_d-6FF6WblZg99No927EgveYcQ&oe=6AF5F02E"}, {"file_name": "screenshot_02.png", "id": "982216994844170", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499619685_982216998177503_4630619148434761190_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=a-E5UkiurDwQ7kNvwHR7U_L&_nc_oc=Adrdogci1sCeiuRb_4KkGj3C3WnM9UjQ0LY-lp5hhKK2RWnRYdoPfyzUhVTGX4gidl8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQTOAq6ZzVakoGSpPR00RyP1N0VJQu3ItF9BYRt33wvD4A&oe=6AF5ECE2"}, {"file_name": "screenshot_03.png", "id": "1498443858661887", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499620504_1498443861995220_3191008372265669718_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Zby0h_d3lMgQ7kNvwFZIoB7&_nc_oc=AdpZFcb6uyVQwZrBeAw1H7CnqVQ7Tgu6eEOyG3HMtF4XlEHWn4o10FmHSCmJ1-CzjT8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQRQqPv-b1U2G9pt_T2RYWqmK_2Xsuf5ZH1eu2zdP2NVDg&oe=6AF5D929"}, {"file_name": "screenshot_04.png", "id": "4192375864336368", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499623443_4192375867669701_7618826882358249819_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=gkX74CR9JmIQ7kNvwH7Dh3n&_nc_oc=AdqjCKnZAWPfN0jx_9fPxyCkdEcF1nZSntxb1ylXMXovreCdSu3mnkzVKQ3zEk5z04I&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQTBKlDC-JFGavK_xcIvtpmYzO1qxJJWS2KmTJuahskDnA&oe=6AF5F043"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "cover-art_2560x1440.png", "id": "1074085312231233", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499619805_1074085315564566_2251211288339206197_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Et1GfEAxIPEQ7kNvwG1QwIX&_nc_oc=AdpSMFBxAwphzzrz8ZJvVehPdTq-A5hDUotnLeOWXUK942J4HY7VgX_kA5Fqxaz3P-o&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQShHAF-CUcTLFRwifB-xyZ34FdFGTagl22jHMSvArMY9Q&oe=6AF5D776"}, "display_name": "GimbapHouse", "keywords": ["cooking", "restaurant", "simulation", "cozy", "korean"], "long_description": "Welcome to **Gimbap House**, a cozy cooking and restaurant management game where you make every gimbap roll with your own hands. Prepare gimbap from start to finish: place the gim, spread the rice, add fillings, roll it up, plate it, slice it, and serve it fresh to your customers.\n\n{1786199042831426}\n\n\n\n\n**GROW YOUR RESTAURANT**\n\nEarn money from each order and use it to grow your business. Unlock new gimbap recipes and drinks, purchase helpful skills and upgrades, and expand from a humble pocha to a food truck, bunsik house, downtown restaurant, and fine dining.\n\n{1026724713586457}\n\n\n**UPGRADE YOUR LIFE**\n\nYour progress continues beyond the kitchen. Upgrade your home from a small gosiwon all the way to a penthouse, and decide how to invest the money you earn.\n\n{1321684233118393}\n\n**COOK YOUR WAY**\n\nUse active and passive skills to make cooking smoother as business gets busier. Spread rice faster, slice more pieces at once, grab drinks from farther away, and more. Watch out for pesky flies that can interfere with your kitchen equipment!\n\n**PLAY IN YOUR LANGUAGE**\n\nGimbap House supports 8 languages: English, French, German, Italian, Korean, Japanese, Russian, and Spanish.\n\n{1692945705126106}\n\n\nCook, serve, upgrade, and build your gimbap business one roll at a time.\n\n\n\n\n", "short_description": "Run your own cozy Gimbap restaurant! Spread rice, add fillings, roll, slice, and serve Gimbap with your own hands. Earn money, unlock new recipes and drinks, upgrade your restaurant, improve your home, and grow from a humble shop into the Gimbap restaurant of your dreams.\n"}]}, "develope